ipv6 default-gateway <ipv6>
ip route <A.B.C.D IPv4 network> <A.B.C.D netmask> <A.B.C.D nexthop> <cost>
ipv6 route <X:X:X:X::X IPv6 network/prefix> <X:X:X:X::X nexthop> <cost>
write memory"
